    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Active MilestonePlan records with no MilestonePlanItem children, or with all items pointing to inactive treatments.
Why it matters: Milestone billing can&apos;t fire — milestones come due but nothing invoices. Direct revenue stop on milestone-based deals.
Suppress a finding: during a documented milestone restructure.
